# Pure Real-World Catchment Map: Luquillo / El Yunque (Puerto Rico)
# 20 x 20 km (EPSG:26920, Center E=205000 N=2026000)
# DEM: USGS 3DEP 1.0m PR_PuertoRicoUSVI_D24 | Imagery: NAIP 0.30m (2022)
# Adaptive Quadtree LOD 0..8 (down to 0.305 m/px across El Yunque, Mameyes, Bisley & Icacos)
# Keys: Wheel=Zoom (adaptive LOD streaming), Right-Drag=Orbit, Middle-Drag=Pan, K=Cycle Contours (0/1/2), Home=Reset View
mode 3d
tab 0
draw 0
ground off
gimbal 1
hud 1
plot 0
text 0
terrain examples/demo/maps/luquillo_pr.epack
contours 1
camera 0 0 450 0.48 -0.82 0.055 1
